  "SubGoals": [],
  "Description": "The PLang.Modules.FileModule goal is designed to handle file operations based on a specified path. It filters the input instructions to extract the file path, constructs an absolute file path using the application path and a relative goal folder path, and then reads the content of the file at that absolute path. If the file is not found, it triggers error handling. Finally, it renders a template using the module type derived from the step.",
